                        ],
                        "form": "кокаини́стах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "97dcbddc-c93d-31b1-abfa-4276a8d17e41",
                        "entry_id": "a687e3a0-8af5-39c2-825f-506b31aa6b31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. наркоман, объектом пристрастия которого является кокаин, то же что кокаиноман"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd944935-27e4-4dff-aede-b62dd4531e29",
                                "sense_id": "97dcbddc-c93d-31b1-abfa-4276a8d17e41",
                                "text": "Если деньги кончаются, кокаинист ищет порошок подешевле."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f4f0c5cc-0968-46e0-a090-737548a9080f",
                        "source_entry_id": "a687e3a0-8af5-39c2-825f-506b31aa6b31",
                        "source_sense_id": "97dcbddc-c93d-31b1-abfa-4276a8d17e41",
                        "target_lang_word": "cocain",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cocain",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "102dcf6a-964a-314a-9446-9fe54252fc2b",
                                        "entry_id": "66df2e93-abc7-3f5a-b786-f8bb0d0ad854",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dated form of cocaine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08f0711e-5232-4d7d-81a4-f2bfecd30748",
                                                "sense_id": "102dcf6a-964a-314a-9446-9fe54252fc2b",
                                                "text": "But in those cases in which the application of cocain would relieve the symptoms, we are sure to get good results[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "087635c8-b5cb-467c-b25c-4f73e618f215",
                                                "sense_id": "102dcf6a-964a-314a-9446-9fe54252fc2b",
                                                "text": "My attention was called to this many years ago, very shortly after the introduction of cocain as a local anesthetic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf6cf6f2-dcfe-4b6f-bd32-1dbd80ca5f69",
                                                "sense_id": "102dcf6a-964a-314a-9446-9fe54252fc2b",
                                                "text": "After opening the bladder (incision extending 1 inch pubically from peritoneal fold) the prostate was injected deeply with 1 per cent. cocain while the pericapsular region was injected with the 1 : 400 novocain solution."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f341d16c-e982-44b2-82c8-59af6d4759f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "a687e3a0-8af5-39c2-825f-506b31aa6b31",
                        "source_sense_id": "97dcbddc-c93d-31b1-abfa-4276a8d17e41",
                        "target_lang_word": "cocainomaniac",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cocainomaniac",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1128949a-7d33-3d01-9ea4-a60809291d5e",
                                        "entry_id": "74c1d7f6-010f-3041-b008-a695f1234b9d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cocaine addict."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fecf049-a363-4cd7-a9e8-842a4cc776c0",
                                                "sense_id": "1128949a-7d33-3d01-9ea4-a60809291d5e",
                                                "text": "Of the three cocainomaniacs, two had epileptiform attacks and one got off with “cramps.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6edb3701-d98a-40b1-9e76-0493a038e343",
                                                "sense_id": "1128949a-7d33-3d01-9ea4-a60809291d5e",
                                                "text": "It may be affirmed that every delirious morphinomaniac is a cocainomaniac."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9d30b6b-7051-4bc6-ae50-a0ce4d4fb8a6",
                                                "sense_id": "1128949a-7d33-3d01-9ea4-a60809291d5e",
                                                "text": "While delivering the final blow to the multi-million-dollar patent-medicine industry, the spectre of the black cocainomaniac—just what the doctor ordered— helped secure the image of the doctor as public benefactor, an image tarnished by a miracle “feel-good” drug, the prescription of which put a doctor on par with a cosmetologist or wine-merchant, who catered to whims rather than needs, and it is in keeping with the tradition of modern medical practice that shortly after the eradication of cocaine, the American medical community began touting a new “feel-good” drug—the amphetamines—synthetic, marketable, and well under the medical thumb—and probably the most dangerous piece of chemistry since Alfred Nobel gave us dynamite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "450cc78d-616e-4801-9ea2-ad18c1610b76",
                        "source_entry_id": "a687e3a0-8af5-39c2-825f-506b31aa6b31",
                        "source_sense_id": "97dcbddc-c93d-31b1-abfa-4276a8d17e41",
                        "target_lang_word": "cocaïnomane",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cocaïnomane",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7d9f4d1-1a55-373e-84c2-51aaabb0c122",
                                        "entry_id": "825237a2-225f-346c-ba4f-b5401c4b1a6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Toxicomane à la cocaïne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f512f30-3619-4aa8-a81d-61b4b4315d8c",
                                                "sense_id": "c7d9f4d1-1a55-373e-84c2-51aaabb0c122",
                                                "text": "Le cocaïnomane finit par n’aimer que sa propre personne – voire ne plus aimer quiconque d’ailleurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
